======================================================================
 1. The NYC box in geohash terms
======================================================================
Geohashes of the box corners at each precision. They agree on the first
few characters and then diverge -- that divergence point is the finest
single prefix that can cover the whole box.
SELECT p AS precision,
       ST_GeoHash(ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-74.1, 40.6), 4326), p) AS sw_corner,
       ST_GeoHash(ST_SetSRID(ST_MakePoint(-73.7, 40.9), 4326), p) AS ne_corner
FROM generate_series(1, 7) AS p;
 precision | sw_corner | ne_corner 
-----------+-----------+-----------
         1 | d         | d
         2 | dr        | dr
         3 | dr5       | dr7
         4 | dr5q      | dr78
         5 | dr5qc     | dr78d
         6 | dr5qcz    | dr78dv
         7 | dr5qcz4   | dr78dvt
(7 rows)

