--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Limit  (cost=206.38..206.63 rows=100 width=32) (actual time=0.018..0.019 rows=2 loops=1)
   Buffers: shared hit=6
   ->  Sort  (cost=206.38..218.88 rows=5000 width=32) (actual time=0.018..0.018 rows=2 loops=1)
         Sort Key: ((geolocation <-> '(-73.9855,40.758)'::point))
         Sort Method: quicksort  Memory: 25kB
         Buffers: shared hit=6
